# branch: total by definition. A tag below n routes to lane tag; a tag of n-1 or more goes to the last
# lane, so nothing panics and nothing is lost. Here tags are the element values [0..5); `branch 3`
# keeps 0 and 1 in lanes 0 and 1, and routes 2, 3 and 4 to lane 2.
# n = 5
# = List ends=[5] <Sum tags=[0, 1, 2, 2, 2] [[0], [1], [2, 3, 4]]>
input iota map (x -> (x, x) branch 3)
